# Post-deploy smoke (2 min)

1. https://hey-maya.ru loads, sidebar works
2. https://hey-maya.ru/api/version → `ok:true`, fresh `buildId`
3. Login: Mail.ru OAuth or send-code (no Load failed)
4. Chat: send one message, get reply
5. Feedback form at bottom of feed — submit once
6. errors.betterstack.com → hey-maya — no new unresolved server errors (optional ping: `/api/betterstack/ping?key=…`)

If build fails on VPS: `pm2 logs maya --lines 80`
